      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `0e8e42a6b2e85287fb545f331887c46cbd6dea2fe4dfa5ba285b8e428fd3780c--recorded-crime-offenders-2015-16-cube-3-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Offenders (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2015-16\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 6 of 6\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | d2c3839c8e6e498b39e507f087b4b2a7f9c22d121ff548c7d84bd1b6f43be258 | missing |\n| \"Table 18\" | 3167f9dc0308b335776afe684cb48f83f4d11494a2e3692dc6c999a7d69040cb | missing |\n| \"Table 19\" | 4b9736a80fe09872c98d1d40d8d730838671a149be1ce29d768063d7aa77973e | missing |\n| \"Table 20\" | 23cbdeef2ccd41ec02bb79b03de37a532748a3b7b7b8230d9a3e5b66559e4c3f | missing |\n| \"Table 21\" | c7bf4cb90f857c95f1d38fcd2e7130eb6db49adbdaf8da26bd911ecef3b9cf0a | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | b05a91660eac60a5cfabdddb960ccbc585fbda9f02f48718a16a3a753ebe72a2 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
